Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:08.95,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}...and you by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.95,0:21:13.75,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf78}Whoa! {\kf70}High,{\kf61} {\kf102}high, {\kf113}high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.75,0:21:19.08,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf49}Ha{\kf40}sha{\kf31}gi{\kf38}da{\kf61}su {\kf32}ki{\kf65}mo{\kf57}chi {\kf161}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.75,0:21:19.08,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf49}は{\kf40}しゃ{\kf31}ぎ{\kf38}だ{\kf61}す{\kf32}気{\kf65}持{\kf56}ち{\kf161}に
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.75,0:21:19.08,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My feelings are ready to burst forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:24.17,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf12}U{\kf27}ta{\kf28}e {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:24.17,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf39}歌{\kf28}え {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:24.17,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.17,0:21:29.39,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf66}Ko{\kf20}e {\kf33}wa {\kf35}do{\kf96}ko {\kf66}ma{\kf56}de {\kf150}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.17,0:21:29.39,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf86}声{\kf33}は{\kf35}ど{\kf96}こ{\kf66}ま{\kf56}で{\kf150}も
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.17,0:21:29.39,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My voice reaches every corner of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.68,0:21:34.60,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf92}Mou {\kf67}high{\kf64} {\kf68}high{\kf32} {\kf120}high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.68,0:21:34.60,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf92}もう {\kf67}high{\kf64} {\kf68}high{\kf32} {\kf120}high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.68,0:21:34.60,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}I'm already high, high, high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.23,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf56}Ma{\kf35}i{\kf29}a{\kf37}ga{\kf28}ru {\kf33}ka{\kf32}ze {\kf66}ni {\kf54}no{\kf141}ri
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.23,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf56}舞{\kf35}い{\kf29}上{\kf37}が{\kf28}る{\kf65}風{\kf66}に{\kf54}乗{\kf141}り
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.23,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}Riding the whirling winds...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:44.61,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf18}U{\kf27}ta{\kf28}e {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:44.61,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf45}歌{\kf28}え {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:44.61,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.03,0:21:50.53,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf56}Ko{\kf34}e {\kf30}mo {\kf34}to{\kf98}bi{\kf67}ha{\kf53}ne{\kf177}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.03,0:21:50.53,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf90}声{\kf30}も{\kf34}飛{\kf98}び{\kf67}跳{\kf53}ね{\kf177}る
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.03,0:21:50.53,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My voice swoops up and down with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Typhoon 13 is continuing to the north with extraordinary force.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Minami Daitou entered the storm's area of effect at around 11PM last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Its effect on transport systems in various areas is currently...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.85,0:00:21.04,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,TL Note: "Unko" in Japanese is "poo". "Unkou" means "running".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.85,0:00:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The TV says the bullet trains are doing a poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not "doing a poo"! "Running"!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Poo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Running!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I bet they said that normal bullet train service is "running", right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That just means they're working like they normally do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.15,0:00:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Woo, woo! The trains are doing a poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.89,0:00:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to go and do a poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:01:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It is predicted that Typhoon 13 will gradually shift its course towards the east...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.68,0:01:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and land in the Tokai area as evening turns into night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They said a typhoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. They come around every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.91,0:01:14.22,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No toilet paper left?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I did a really amazing one!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.44,0:01:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bring a ruler!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They do say boys don't mature as fast as girls, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.38,0:01:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She must really have it hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.95,0:03:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pick you up early today, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.61,0:03:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.77,0:03:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.31,0:03:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.87,0:03:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you leave just the right amount of space where I drew the circles, it'll look nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.89,0:03:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.03,0:03:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, how much is "just the right amount"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.90,0:03:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.09,0:03:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How many centimetres? How many millimetres?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:04:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to draw these circles!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.45,0:04:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.48,0:04:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll leave the rest for homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For your next class, everyone in the first year will be drawing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather outside beside your own morning glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.50,0:04:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are sandbags really that heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not even the afternoon, and I'm already burned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.68,0:04:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just our luck that we have a bunch of samples to ship out on top of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.45,0:04:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My kids' educational insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! But they're still babies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.15,0:04:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It wouldn't be worth it to get insurance if I waited until they were older.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I guess so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.78,0:04:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I paid for mine, too, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though I doubt my kid will make it to university.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We've got two kids, so it's tough going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ours is still so young that we've got to worry about daycare fees, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.63,0:05:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Outgrows his clothes straight away, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.95,0:05:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though, we're lucky enough to get pensions and health insurance, even though we're not with a company.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.41,0:05:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about life insurance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.81,0:05:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My wife took care of that before I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.94,0:05:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mine pays a lump sum if I die, and hers is tied to her savings account.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.52,0:05:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty basic stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys really are dads, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.97,0:05:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder how much insurance costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The kid next door is so loud that we want to move, but we don't have the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.19,0:05:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Kind of makes you wonder what you're working for, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.11,0:05:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should take a good look at us, too. This is what happens when you get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:05:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have a girlfriend, anyway, so I'm fine.{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They say that, but no matter how much they complain...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...you can tell they're perfectly content.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.52,0:06:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't imagine any of them ever becoming like Rin's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.66,0:06:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down and draw like you're supposed to!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about your drawing board?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The ground is flat, so I don't really need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.49,0:06:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not acceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you're told to bring something, you bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right now! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.54,0:07:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, your picture's really good, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right, it's amazing! So pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It really {\i1}is{\i0} good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The colours of these two flowers are slightly different,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.45,0:07:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and that's reflected in Rin-san's drawing, with a purple flower and a blue one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was observant of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.24,0:07:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun and the others are messing around again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.33,0:07:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.48,0:07:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's drawing time right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your morning glories are amazing, Kouki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.86,0:07:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be a waste not to sketch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind it, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tatsumi-sensei, {\i1}I'm{\i0} his teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.15,0:08:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san, why do you always do your best to disturb everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down and start drawing already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And no funny faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have Kouki's hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.01,0:08:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Kouki-san! You boys! Stop messing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.22,0:08:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get back here at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.68,0:08:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:08:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down and draw properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.23,0:08:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let them distract you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was amazing, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's always acting up, and he's scary when he gets mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.07,0:09:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll bully you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.37,0:09:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He will not! We were at nursery together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.59,0:09:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.86,0:10:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys have to meet your kids at six, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. We're cutting it close today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, let's get this done and dusted!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.81,0:10:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.78,0:10:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, looks like you got soaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.99,0:10:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Your father's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.82,0:10:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.73,0:10:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.29,0:10:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go and get Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.47,0:10:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The wind's gotten stronger, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I wanted to get here earlier. Am I the last to pick up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.80,0:10:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just you and Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.07,0:10:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a storm, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. It's pretty wild outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.86,0:11:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.23,0:11:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,An umbrella's flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.03,0:11:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.06,0:11:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.73,0:11:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you later, Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.40,0:11:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go home together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.40,0:11:42.13,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like to go home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!{Aww, Kouki is sometimes cute... <3}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.91,0:11:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, but there's really no way that we can...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.97,0:11:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know. But the wind's only going to get more and more fierce, so can...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.55,0:12:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I call Nitani-san and see if it's okay, and then pass her over to you for confirmation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.61,0:12:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, if you put it like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.80,0:12:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That means we'll be going home early, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.22,0:12:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.49,0:12:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.91,0:12:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,R-Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.31,0:12:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's dangerous. Get behind me and follow closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go and get you towels.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.98,0:13:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, the storm shutters!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cool! Let me try!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go. Don't get your fingers caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's sort of like a secret base, huh? {Ano Hana~ <3}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.55,0:13:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's in my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll rinse it out. Keep your eyes shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.98,0:14:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Dry the rest yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.71,0:14:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, your back is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.72,0:14:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening! It's Nitani!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.47,0:14:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right! Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So they let you out of work early?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.59,0:14:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I felt like I was sticking my nose in where I shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all! You've been such a big help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.47,0:14:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Kouki got soaked, too.{Thanks Psi~}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.69,0:14:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I really don't know how to begin to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.64,0:14:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That suits you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.68,0:15:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lend me yours, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.19,0:15:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've told you to call him "Daikichi-san"!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.41,0:15:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He said "Daikichi" is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm more comfortable with that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.03,0:15:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.90,0:15:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's best for Daikichi to just be Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.65,0:15:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're really good at that, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.93,0:15:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can use a knife, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.89,0:15:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're already a big girl, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi works with the flame, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.29,0:15:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you never help out...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll cut, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.49,0:15:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll lend you my knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no! Onions are the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.45,0:15:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch! Go and rinse your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:53.41,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no, I'm crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.95,0:16:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These are supposed to be... hamburgers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.02,0:16:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Looks good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.57,0:16:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They are not! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.51,0:16:15.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure they'll taste fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! The eggs are hard boiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.97,0:16:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you peel them for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.66,0:16:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're really good at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.45,0:16:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That Rin... She's getting so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, do you love your mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.92,0:16:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well... She's kind of an old nag, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a definite feeling of contentedness here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.03,0:17:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.71,0:17:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't even say "let's eat".
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.15,0:17:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.39,0:17:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, use your chopsticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.74,0:17:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know. I'm just gathering it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.16,0:17:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.35,0:17:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Food always tastes better when everyone eats together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat here again tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,K-Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can leave the dishes there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.07,0:18:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.99,0:18:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.26,0:18:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And then, it hit him on the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're so excited...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.47,0:18:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't been able to give Kouki many opportunities like this until now, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really glad we had this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.03,0:18:25.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.85,0:18:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all! We should be thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei said we didn't need those circles!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.43,0:18:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Being able to seem him smile like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so glad I got off work early.{This show actually makes me want to be a mother someday... ^^ This is a little scary~}{I think you'd be a wonderful mother, Mimi~}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.89,0:18:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's raising a child on her own, just like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.86,0:18:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Come here a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.26,0:18:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'd better be off, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:18:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall I call a taxi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.67,0:19:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you stay over?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But Reina-chan and her mum stayed over...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.82,0:19:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.23,0:19:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.49,0:19:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We had fun, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.43,0:20:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.26,0:22:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The typhoon's gone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.43,0:22:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.94,0:22:17.89,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.91,0:22:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's here already!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.15,0:22:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's early again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.16,0:22:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.51,0:22:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.51,0:22:28.03,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.89,0:22:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to open the storm shutters...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.05,0:22:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The sky's as clear as can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.34,0:22:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.93,0:22:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, we're going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.69,0:22:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Later!
